{"id":51153,"ord":28,"n_segments":158,"prev":51152,"next":51154,"doc":{"id":"67246","title":"67246_Buck Clayton oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Buck Clayton","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/67246/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=67246"},"chapter":"Learning the trade in Los Angeles","title":"Joining Charlie Echols's fourteen-piece band; Lawrence Brown question","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"He joined Echols's big band; Dance and Clayton discuss whether Lawrence Brown played in it.","period":"c. 1932","year_from":1932,"year_to":1932,"words":96,"start":[46,6],"end":[47,11],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=67246#s51153","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Charlie Echols's band","focus":1,"leader":"Charlie Echols"},{"name":"Paul Howard's Quality Serenaders","focus":1,"leader":"Paul Howard"}]},"people":[{"name":"Lawrence Brown","qid":"Q727621","n":4},{"name":"Paul Howard","qid":"Q7151403","n":2},{"name":"Charlie Echols","qid":"Q30323883","n":1}],"story":{"theme":18,"theme_name":"Getting paid: wages, tips and leaving over money","community":39,"community_name":"Battling at the Savoy Ballroom","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":46,"b":6,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"What was that?"},{"p":46,"b":7,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"A band called 'Charlie Echols'."},{"p":46,"b":8,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Oh yes. H"},{"p":46,"b":9,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"He has a big band, fourteen pieces."},{"p":46,"b":10,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Wasn't Lawrence Brown in that at one time?"},{"p":47,"b":0,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"No."},{"p":47,"b":1,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"No?"},{"p":47,"b":2,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"Lawrence at that time was playing with ......"},{"p":47,"b":3,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Was he with, what was he called, Paul Howard ?"},{"p":47,"b":4,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"Paul Howard Quality Serenaders."},{"p":47,"b":5,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Right."},{"p":47,"b":6,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"Yes, that was a good little band."},{"p":47,"b":7,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"But I'm under the impression that Brown Lawrence/once told me that he did play with Charlie Echols"},{"p":47,"b":8,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"Well maybe, Lawrence told you that? Well maybe."},{"p":47,"b":9,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"I believe so."},{"p":47,"b":10,"s":"MR. CLAYTON","x":"He may have."},{"p":47,"b":11,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Possibly it was before you were there."}]}